            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 7.1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ke Ch. 17.1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio Daudi eema ebweeni wabwe mala ababoolela ali, “Balebe base ne babaandu base, ndekeeresie. Ndi ne enganakani eye khukhwombakha enju eye khuraamo Lisanduku lie Ndakaano ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nende niio ara bikele biewe. Narekekha liliombakha lie Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Wele anganisie khukiombakha. Sikila ese ndi omunamae lundi nachukha sifuki sikali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli andobora ese munju eya paapa khuba omwami khu Isiraeli mindali na mindali. Aarobora ekholo eya Yuda eane bubwimeelesi. Ne khukhwama munju eya Yuda arobora enju eya Paapa wase. Khukhwama mu be nju eyo yoosi basiimisibwa khu khumbukula ese, mala anjamiie mbe omwami khu Isiraeli yoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ambeelesia babaana basoleeli bakali. Ne khukhwama mu nibo aarobora Solomoni amiie Isiraeli mu bwami bwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela ese ali, ‘Omusoleeli wowo Solomoni niye oliombakha Lukaangu lwase. Namuroboore abe nga omwana wase mala ese ndaba nga raraawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakhola bubwami bwewe buyindile mindali na mindali aaba ne achiililila khuria kamalaka kase nga ne alikho akhola luno.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nono luno ebweeni we Baisiraeli boosi ne baloleleele, libuusiana lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne mu moni cha Wele wefwe, liinda kamalaka ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo. Ne okhola orio enywe mucha khunyoola sibala silayi sino. Ne mulisilekhela chiselukho chichiicha khulwa mindali na mindali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne nawe Solomoni, mwana wase, manya Wele owa raraao ne khumukholela ne kumwoyo kwoosi ne lilienya sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amanyile kimiooyo kiefwe kioosi lundi amanyile kamakhuwa kefwe koosi ne chinganakani chefwe choosi. Ne omuyiima ne omunyoola. Ne omuloba, alikhwanjukhila elala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhoya okhebulile oli Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhurobore ewe khukhwombakha Lukaangu lwewe lutakatifu. Nono ba ne kamaani mala okhole orio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Daudi aelesia Solomoni liiandike lie khukhwombakha Lukaangu, chinju che Lukaangu choosi ne chisiro che kamabiikhilo, ne chisiro che mukari ne chikorofa, ne lusiro lwe ndebe eye siisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaba lundi amuelesia liiandike lia buli siindu nilio aba nalio mu mebaasio kewe khulwe chimbia che enju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne chisiro choosi chichachibotookhelela, kamabiikhilo ke enju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne kamabiikhilo ke biianwa bibiaulwa khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaba lundi Daudi akhola lirekekha lie bipupu bie ba basaayi ne Balawi khukhola kimilimo kiabwe kie Lukaangu. Ne khuliinda bibiindu bie lisaaya mu Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arekekha efwesa ne esahabu sikelo sisioola khurumikhwa mu khung'oona bibiindu bie mu Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi amwekesia busiro bwe esahabu niyo ang'oonela biteetwe bie chisahabu ne chitaa chabio ne biteetwe bie efwesa ne chitaa chabio. Amwekesia bino bioosi khuloondekhana ne buli kumulimo kwe siteetwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aamukholela lirekekha lie busiro bwe esahabu eya buli emesa eye kumukaati kumutakatifu nende buli esahabu eye chimesa che esahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaba lundi arekekha sikelo sie esahabu yong'ene sisiola sinyala siarumikhwa khung'oona chiuma, bibuumba ne bikoombe, sikelo sia buli esahabu eye bibuumba ne efwesa eye bibuumba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne esahabu enosie sikelo siina erumikhwa mu khung'oona alutare eye khukhwoseliakho bibiindu biiunya bulayi ne khung'oona likaari khulwe esahabu khulwe chikerubi chichabalaayanga chindaa chacho ne chifuunikha Lisanduku lie Ndakaano eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Daudi aloma ali bibiindu bino bioosi naandika ne ndangirirwe ne Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Aanjeeta khumanya buli siindu mu lirekekha lino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi aboolela omusoleeli wewe Solomoni ali, “Ba ne sinani ne bunyindaafu. Okharia tawe namwe okhafwa kumwoyo tawe. Sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wase ali ne nawe. Se alakhukwisia namwe akhulekhe tawe khukhwola nga ne omala kimilimo kikienyekha khukhola khu nju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bipupu bie basaayi ne Balawi berekekha khukhola kimilimo khu nju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Buli mundu oli ne bukesi bwe kumulimo kwosi kwosi enya khu khuyeeta ewe. Ne babaandu boosi ne babemeelesi babwe baliria lilaka liowo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
